155
]. Based on the previously published phase separate protein database PhaSepDB, Chen et al. divided phase separate proteins into two sets of spontaneous phase separate proteins (hSaPS) and interaction dependent phase separate proteins (hPdPS). The distribution of the two phase isolated protein sets and the background protein sets were significantly different from each other by comparing the multimodal characteristics [
